A vast cosmic cloudscape at dawn, rendered in Vincent van Gogh's swirling, expressive brushstroke style. Thousands of small, luminous orbs float and swarm like fireflies through turbulent indigo and gold skies, each orb glowing with inner light. Some orbs fade and dissolve while new ones spontaneously ignite nearby, suggesting constant renewal. Below, a single massive monolithic server tower crumbles into fragments that transform mid-air into these dancing light particles. The swirling sky patterns echo Starry Night's movement, with thick impasto texture creating depth and energy. Deep blues transition to warm amber and rose at the horizon where a new sun breaks through. The composition emphasizes the transformation from rigid singular structure to fluid, distributed constellation of interconnected points of light moving in organic harmony.
